        },
        {
          "ruleId": "secret-in-file",
          "ruleIndex": 3,
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "The file holds the key \"mnemonic\", which names a seed, a mnemonic or a private key. The tool never reads one, and the value is not shown. Fix: Remove the value from the file and from wherever the file was copied, treat it as exposed and move what it controls to a new key. Metadata is public once it is uploaded."
          },
